<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>RSVP Confirmation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #1E2A44;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 42px;
        font-family: 'Mellira', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
        font-weight: normal;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .content p {
        margin: 0 0 1em 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .summary {
        border-left: 4px solid #6595BF;
        padding: 15px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 0.95em;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .summary p {
        margin: 0 0 0.5em 0;
    }
    .summary ul {
        margin-top: 0.5em;
        padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888888;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Veronica & Bishoy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>Thank you for your RSVP! We have recorded your response and are so excited to celebrate with you.</p>
      
      <div class="summary">
        <p><strong>Your Response Summary:</strong></p>
        <p>Attending Ceremony: <strong><%= ceremony ? 'Yes' : 'No' %></strong></p>
        <p>Attending Reception: <strong><%= reception ? 'Yes' : 'No' %></strong></p>
        
        <% if (reception) { %>
          <p>Place Card Name: <strong><%= placeCardName || 'Not provided' %></strong></p>
          <p>Dietary Requirements: <strong><%= dietary || 'None' %></strong></p>
        <% } %>

        <% if (ceremony && reception) { %>
          <p>Transport Required: <strong><%= transport ? 'Yes' : 'No' %></strong></p>
        <% } %>

        <% if (guests && guests.length > 0) { %>
          <p><strong>Additional Guests:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <% guests.forEach(guest => { %>
              <li><%= guest.placeCardName %> <% if (guest.dietary) { %>(<%= guest.dietary %>)<% } %></li>
            <% }); %>
          </ul>
        <% } %>

        <p>Printed Invitation: <strong><%= printedInvite ? 'Yes' : 'No' %></strong></p>
        <p>Notes: <strong><%= notes || 'None' %></strong></p>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">If you need to make any changes, please visit the RSVP page on our website before the deadline on <strong>September 10th, 2025</strong>. You can also reply to this email with any questions.</p>
      <p>Warmly,<br>Veronica & Bishoy</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2025 Veronica & Bishoy. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
